<title>USA: Omaha hogs off $1.50/2.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs off $1.50/2.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were slow, $1.50-2.50 lower. Top $59.00 per cwt. - USDA US 1-3    230-260 lbs closed 58.00, opening sales reached 59.00</p>
<p>US 2-3    260-280 lbs    57.00-58.25</p>
<p>	    280-300 lbs    55.00-57.75</p>
<p>Sows: Steady to 1.00 lower. Top 54.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    350-450 lbs    49.25-49.75</p>
<p>US 2-3    500-650 lbs    53.00-54.00</p>
</text>
